===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|fr}} {{term|refrain|lang=fr}}, from the {{etyl|fro}} verb {{term|refraindre||to break off, repeat|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|re-||back, again|lang=la}} + {{term|frango|frangō|break|lang=la}}; compare Occitan {{term|refranhs||a refrain|lang=oc}}, {{term|refranher||to repeat|lang=oc}}. See {{term|refract|lang=en}} and the verb {{term|refrain|lang=en}}.

====Noun====
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# The [[chorus]] or [[burden]] of a [[song]] [[repeat]]ed at the end of each [[verse]] or [[stanza]].
#: ''We hear the wild '''refrain'''.'' Whittier.

